# Agent skills
# Canonical skill content lives in .agents/skills/ and IS tracked.
# .claude/skills/ is a generated discovery layer: `npx skills add` writes
# symlinks/junctions there pointing back at .agents/skills/. Those links don't
# reproduce on a fresh clone (Windows needs Developer Mode for symlinks), so
# ignore them and let the installer regenerate. The dirs re-included below are
# real, self-contained skills that predate that layout.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/caveman/
!.claude/skills/grill-me/
!.claude/skills/grill-with-docs/
!.claude/skills/handoff/
!.claude/skills/second-brain/
!.claude/skills/second-brain-ingest/
!.claude/skills/second-brain-lint/
!.claude/skills/second-brain-query/
!.claude/skills/setup-matt-pocock-skills/
!.claude/skills/to-prd/
